(7336797, 1144675, 150277, '<td valign="top">This was one of my ribbon picks, I really loved the look of this image.  It almost felt like the dandelion was frozen, and all the muted, ice, cold colors in the shot really were unique and worked imho.  I thought it was just gorgeous.  Cold, but gorgeous.</td>', 'This was one of my ribbon picks, I really loved the look of this image.  It almost felt like the dandelion was frozen, and all the muted, ice, cold colors in the shot really were unique and worked imho.  I thought it was just gorgeous.  Cold, but gorgeous.', '2015-04-02 14:40:49.000000', NULL, 0),
