(7343068, 1145149, 180170, '<td valign="top">Glad you put your pic on ''the_rkp''. I went looking for it after tiny''s comment but couldn''t find the image he was referring to.<br/>I saw a similar image on the internet a while ago and thought I would love to get a picture of my daughter doing that some day. When the challenge came up it, I remembered the idea and it gave me the opportunity to finally take the shot. <br/>I think I still have the link somewhere if your interested? <br/>Love your photo btw :)</td>', 'Glad you put your pic on ''the_rkp''. I went looking for it after tiny''s comment but couldn''t find the image he was referring to.I saw a similar image on the internet a while ago and thought I would love to get a picture of my daughter doing that some day. When the challenge came up it, I remembered the idea and it gave me the opportunity to finally take the shot. I think I still have the link somewhere if your interested? Love your photo btw :)', '2015-04-17 03:15:30.000000', NULL, 0),
